    "Reason : 1 - The information submitted pursuant to discharge of Condition 9 is insufficient because it does not include the maintenance tasks and frequencies required for the water butts and flow control. The calculations do not use the latest rainfall data (FEH22), do not include the full site area, and provide only results for the summer storm event, contrary to the requirements of Local Plan policy EQ3 (Flood risk and surface water management) and London Plan policy SI13 (Sustainable drainage) and would therefore fail to prevent the risk of flooding to and from the site."
